<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="6">

  <DocumentRef DateTime="20260928T020318" id="b3d9ac55-0090-4b0c-b7f3-2efc8362f065">
    <XRef DateTime="20260927T211614" id="31eebf07-025b-4252-816e-1747d15525b1"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260927T224513" id="87ff10b2-2ca7-45b1-97a1-5a9f17d174ea"/>
  </DocumentRef>

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Outline 1" id="a081e3ae-d36e-4e3d-849a-31918bfc749c">
      <Text>Act 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Summary" id="77b85cc0-f437-4d1e-b091-9a6673da3a5d">
      <Text>Building context of their lives and routines and the goals Rye has set with indicators that his mom is sick and not doing anything about it</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Outline 2" id="8f24cd4f-590c-45f6-98e8-25c0f9176d5c">
      <Text>Plot Point 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.12" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="15" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Summary" id="4a96e368-cfa0-472b-a5cb-1f2f29ebb678">
      <Text>Discovers Nancy's cancer and first argument. She didn't tell him or receive treatment</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="965105b4-18fe-4b2a-a44e-cde2418456b5">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Scene 1: introduction </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d7b47aa0-05fa-48d3-a65e-d8bce8e484d9">
      <Text>FADE IN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="50aa703c-d6af-4b72-95cb-50ede4796dd3">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. WhitE PICKET FENCE LAWN - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6b813057-7613-4f13-b823-6b3acb0e4074">
      <Text>Open with credit scenes and fun animations with Rye’s rough hands as he mows different lawns of Huntington Beach neighborhoods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="de1fcb0e-62e4-4467-b83a-8558869741ea">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. Nail salon - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6b813057-7613-4f13-b823-6b3acb0e4074">
      <Text>Juxtaposed to back and forth scenes of what seems like a dainty hand being painted. Swanky, upbeat, salon music.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="188658d2-a590-4417-aa74-927387a85e30">
      <Text>CREDITS END</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ce66424e-5476-4477-8c5c-5e932a290711">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="21913e77-c11c-4d91-bbcf-ee191c19d559"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. EVENT VENUE - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c6502903-5fcf-49b9-950c-dd668804b7ac">
      <Text>RYE [18, Vietnamese] narrates from behind a podium while wearing a graduation cap.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="250a66e4-7e61-47e9-976d-cf3d41766e45">
      <Text>RYE (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0590f6aa-a170-4366-8807-0f098d002e44">
      <Text>For those of you here who don’t know,</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="bc18aef8-ca25-45c9-b1fa-b5290e85bcec">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="4b1caedc-0601-4b3b-93ed-7f557b5a760b"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Nail salon - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="188658d2-a590-4417-aa74-927387a85e30">
      <Text>A small eye opens on the other side of a tacky rectangular fish tank of a nail salon. We’re looking through as the eye follows the fish back and forth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2f361c51-b6b5-4f48-929a-c292ccf1bd1f">
      <Text>Rye (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ffc2482d-9ff5-4dba-ba57-da7106043f6c">
      <Text>Vietnamese is a monosyllabic language.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="99ae3f3f-59a8-4e04-87bf-9d677d7ee2dc">
      <Text>Young Rye suddenly digs his hand in the tank to snatch a fish before commotion ensues to stop him. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="84808b71-df76-4fc1-8663-f8f09ada00f7">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="44784dd8-222f-4bde-9472-633fa4d10051"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. vietnamese school - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="99ae3f3f-59a8-4e04-87bf-9d677d7ee2dc">
      <Text>Scene cuts to him at a foldout table desk sitting beside other Vietnamese kids, slightly older.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="12e9b5bb-ff12-4734-b775-96fe6855f0e4">
      <Text>Rye (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9e3b4dcc-bfea-4136-a3b4-d103e4d10e6b">
      <Text>There are 6 distinct tones: </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">sắc</Text>
      <Text>, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">huyền</Text>
      <Text>, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">nặng</Text>
      <Text>, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">hỏi</Text>
      <Text>, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ngã</Text>
      <Text>, and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ngang</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8d437381-4d4a-42b9-8bae-ac657877e951">
      <Text>Animation as he explains each of them, like cartoons with onomatopoeias popping out for each.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5194586c-a02b-470e-90f2-8c6d4369fea8">
      <Text>Rye is attempting to focus but looks lost.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ccbbdded-7aa8-4057-bb47-89460e48ca28">
      <Text>Rye (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4385e661-a78e-48a5-b575-e598b6d1bb5c">
      <Text>It is very direct and straightforward–but one cannot reduce them to just sounds, they’re feelings carried through the mouth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7d79879-d020-40af-b5b0-96026d058e38">
      <Text>He raises his hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4960f82a-fbef-4b1b-b114-21d027d68463">
      <Text>Rye (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="505e9163-1aa7-413a-ba45-70c0f21ed19c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hỏi</Text>
      <Text> means to ask, so, yes, the tone you use like a question.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c6b6817b-fbda-4648-845a-08303f51b8a4">
      <Text>Rye’s lips start moving without the voiceover.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fe23fbff-07d9-4969-b15d-f265f614a19d">
      <Text>His classmates turn around dramatically and stare at him like he’s braindead. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="880d424f-511c-4521-82cd-6f82f7b5bdf6">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="d995068e-f85c-4b39-846d-5938a8f08122"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. Basketball court - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fe23fbff-07d9-4969-b15d-f265f614a19d">
      <Text>Montage of Rye playing basketball outside with his friends, slightly older again. He goes for a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">jumpshot</Text>
      <Text>. His aim is terrible, but he’s a big boy and can do some damage by plowing through everyone else and snatching the ball.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6ebbf143-3654-48e3-a8f1-ba66ac990d5d">
      <Text>Rye (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c67ea067-df6f-45e3-8b08-0e5137ed00ad">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Nặng</Text>
      <Text> means heavy, so you pronounce the word like you’ve been grasping a heavy boulder and that syllable is the moment you can relieve yourself of carrying it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5e5b895b-c073-4b40-af1d-5e0261473089">
      <Text>He makes a layup while other smaller kids are simply afraid of getting close to him. He thinks he’s good at the game.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="c714e4e2-a352-4deb-be7b-e9cf913f5d92">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="1a83b75e-ed70-4ada-928f-2f44216b75ef"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Nail salon - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d72725b0-d1fa-4878-b193-6ac25f3a98a0">
      <Text>The eye is older and Rye stands behind the tank, now 18 years old, still tracking the fish back and forth. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="cc14504a-3c98-441a-8224-b05f150cc8cd">
      <Text>Camera follows him up as he stands completely upright and walks to the right, handheld pan to him walking over to sit on a stool beside his mom as she works on the original set of nails we saw in the intro.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="14d7710b-1ad6-4f24-9293-04c8fade9b06">
      <Text>Rye (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="389d9ccc-5046-4cc4-8e71-b25599b70d40">
      <Text>In Vietnamese, we have two words for love: </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">yeu</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">thuong</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="25ce165a-eabd-4c25-b0db-e001a64d412a">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Scene 2: LIFE WITH NANCY AND RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9ee86e88-b298-4369-a1da-cae7fd947e57">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 6/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CLIENT">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="5e8ff2bd-9f0c-4663-a9c3-66288e50c387"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NANCY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="dd73dd2a-7b52-4316-bbcd-6772a2ba5369"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="a9ef02e3-d188-415c-a0a3-eadbce1c4df8"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Nail SALON - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="69532875-7176-4296-844d-38566329f21c">
      <Text>NANCY [Mid 30s, glamorous] is working on nails of CLIENT [White, Valley Girl Accent] and chattering with an accent that tells you she’s Vietnamese before she does. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="10212643-d121-4d0e-8a2b-d351d9e6bc13">
      <Text>Nancy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a8d48c40-cf71-4029-a9f2-79f3569d3c28">
      <Text>Honey, you want the gel nail or the acrylic?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="046ca854-cfc5-4e81-b671-fde6aad2c1a4">
      <Text>Rye rolls his eyes from his stool.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="bd88ef3d-63e7-4444-939f-24bd1665ec16">
      <Text>Nancy kicks his foot under the desk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d62cbd0b-ae2c-4976-8914-b54f1dd81eed">
      <Text>Rye continues scrolling on his phone until she’s done.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0c973bed-1abd-41f3-b6ce-93c14194528c">
      <Text>NANCY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="117519fa-ed64-42a1-89d5-7f525d455443">
      <Text>Okay, honey, you done. You want the Apple Pay again or you have cash this time?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c69676be-8658-4651-8518-0579f416b2b7">
      <Text>Rye is now doing some homework but watching their whole interaction.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0755e895-b024-4f3c-b37f-704312f3dc35">
      <Text>CLIENT (chewing gum)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="724e1742-53df-4fec-9136-44dab2542411">
      <Text>Apple Pay. Thank </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">youu</Text>
      <Text>~</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1f329130-42f8-4281-ac45-6e9ac90c325b">
      <Text>Client leaves and Nancy sits back down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6031784d-1ff3-45eb-bf11-61ade92fdbc3">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ed2f94f2-0a7c-4cc5-b2b5-f773a3f7755c">
      <Text>Ma oi, why do you always have to do that dumb accent thing?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e9699d7b-5576-4015-b972-5e30f4eaa6ef">
      <Text>NANCY (with real voice)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5f534dce-9410-4ab5-b61c-68d402e95bee">
      <Text>Why you always in my business?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f42e3beb-4f73-4ca1-9f45-0d086e929556">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="76db835a-6a4a-4cef-b0a8-7c80d2c21a88">
      <Text>It’s weird, ma.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9b6632e6-0787-43e9-bc89-25f0c9f94eca">
      <Text>NANCY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="47630e1d-1499-4af8-b303-be6d9ca626b2">
      <Text>I get more tips that way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="af5a28d7-3d35-4ad0-a877-872f83e001d6">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8408def4-0b6b-46f9-996c-d56037f191fb">
      <Text>You only do it on white people...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="12d0cd2f-6537-4693-a4d7-b6bc1098dd76">
      <Text>Nancy (in fake accent)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="582eb774-5b54-4e39-b096-1df168a0981f">
      <Text>They like it, honey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="49112ed5-2ba6-41c0-802a-698c94bcbcbd"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="26b224ef-0b75-4d3d-99f1-d2ea913d56d4">
      <Text>Rye rolls his eyes again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ffd70882-9480-41be-bb08-2165e4f1dab7">
      <Text>NanCY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4dfaf9dc-52a2-44d9-a47c-c5c6346a2340">
      <Text>Stop doing that, boy. It’s disrespectful.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c4650e14-2e6a-4894-812e-c319114ee1f0">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="11951850-769d-4bba-852a-9dc487100450">
      <Text>Da. I’m going to work now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="039f0aff-ce9a-4493-a492-5fc64d0eb7af">
      <Text>Nancy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8f541e7c-54d9-4a67-ad56-c32237d1333f">
      <Text>Ok. You finish your homework? Who today?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="02f81889-17c7-439f-b39f-949ca8fc212e">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e82f3052-4548-4288-92f9-c8764bc3ff68">
      <Text>Cierra down the street again. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="84abccf4-01b3-45f2-ba05-90a0cf4820ad">
      <Text>NANCY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f3737615-0e73-49c0-811a-b6b33843b9af">
      <Text>Homework?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="472d8ef6-068f-4af1-ab5e-bce76ee9651f">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a2006061-6be2-454b-bfdd-74ec4a8ae93f">
      <Text>Yeah, mostly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7f0ea2ed-a72b-455a-b025-aa5ac12f6c3e">
      <Text>NaNCY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca7400b0-d809-4989-9ccc-7b581f570097">
      <Text>Imma smack you up if you lie to me again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5492c091-1b19-4d5c-832f-026158c11f70">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="46c2a97f-22d7-4d23-a9c7-20b09eb39da2">
      <Text>Ok, mom. Should I come back after or will you be home?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4d27a993-a1b7-4f20-beaa-60a4c6c4e7b7">
      <Text>NANCY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f364ae05-058d-4cb8-a685-3a8839edefdb">
      <Text>I’ll be here. Make sure to give her a hug. Maybe she’ll tip you more. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ca77cff6-6ec8-4c76-92d9-9454fe831b7d">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9afb442e-a833-42b2-bd75-eec99987f72d">
      <Text>That’s messed up, Ma. Bye. Love you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1fe9befa-01cd-4296-b19b-5bd82061eecd">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="4" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>ScENE 3: landscaping</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="197bb38f-bff1-45d5-9bdd-623ec2d56029">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="4" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CIERRA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="616b8bc5-418f-4d4d-87e9-215261ed8e42"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="55ae2c64-c0cd-4952-acbf-09eff6896028"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. whiTE PICKET FENCE LAWN - evening</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="71efb773-f3c9-4d87-812c-9cec5583a459">
      <Text>Rye wears headphones. He’s enjoying himself as he clips the shrubbery and mows the lawn while the sun sets. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0a273ca9-3699-492a-b7eb-79ce603ab5a3">
      <Text>Rye rings CIERRA’S [Old, petite, hard of hearing] doorbell.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6d109dd5-0a2f-4737-acba-616d3d9f8bbf">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="05a9aed0-d95c-4a06-bb1d-859967d2901e">
      <Text>Hi, Ms. Cierra. I’m done with your yard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="72f57e1f-aae0-4d73-ad40-501eef6334bc">
      <Text>CIERRA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5933f360-c143-4b0c-b3f7-ecf4be2496df">
      <Text>Thank you, sweetheart.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f73816ef-0e25-4387-903f-4664e0d0f71c">
      <Text>Cierra gives him a hug then looks around in admiration. There’s a shrub that’s been cut to look like a bunny.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1673cc62-8dc4-44e9-a31d-23dea2d5338c">
      <Text>CIERRA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9e7fa684-d18b-4da9-bbe8-ad83d001caad">
      <Text>It’s perfect, as always. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="63bccfe7-7b8d-44c0-8828-ffa1d616b7d2">
      <Text>Cierra hugs him. She takes out her wallet and shakily hands him two hundreds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5bfe1f1b-02b3-4d96-9b14-a6fd56b05a33">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9d1fbc85-be97-40e5-a6e7-e750ba86d2d6">
      <Text>Oh, I can’t take this.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3b1f621f-2bea-42ea-8898-f3b64e50a529">
      <Text>Cierra</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c58fb7ad-ceb8-4af7-8bf7-73be2a7a2f49">
      <Text>Where else will my money go, dear? I’m old. I can’t hear much. A pretty sight in my yard means twice as much as a pretty song.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e6bda579-7e13-4b1b-9ab9-0002accc23d2">
      <Text>Rye reluctantly takes the bills. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="abde4f87-effe-4a1e-8d35-33de3bc4ed9c">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8c6c268e-ce3f-402f-ab11-8cb9a31d22a3">
      <Text>Thank you, Ms. Cierra.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b00370c9-6732-4e48-b272-ae508ec9927f">
      <Text>CIERRA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f1daaed1-1fd6-45b2-880f-fe44083b0b09">
      <Text>Yes. Come back sooner than later.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f7881ce4-817a-4915-a0b7-249b6318afc3">
      <Text>On his way out, Rye takes a ribbon from his pocket and ties it around an ear of the shrub bunny.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="fa6d42d0-bb44-4d39-91b9-b75c0537d79a">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="5" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="1ccd4a29-6e45-4500-b9e2-0fda679a8781"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NANCY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="5fbead61-b953-4ae7-bfcb-4837d036a5eb"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="257c35e3-4c07-443d-b690-e16ed0182737"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Scene 4: daniel enters</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4cb732e2-3262-49c9-afe7-e61da4833b8b">
      <Text>The salon bell rings as Rye enters. Sitting in the stool beside Nancy is DANIEL [Early 40s, Black American, glasses]. Rye daps him up and side-hugs Nancy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="39b2bc9f-f65b-460a-ade8-3e502ebfa0dd">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="96cbf691-69ee-4555-9527-df983bd6eaad">
      <Text>Hey, Rye Guy. How was work?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9ec2e74f-cb5f-48d0-80b2-430b3a9df8fa">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1d19c379-e51f-4309-90a0-a61345d4ccc6">
      <Text>Not too bad. Two yards today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="036c673c-4fdc-4ebb-82ff-d406e23e4a6f">
      <Text>Nancy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="25a0c115-ed66-411f-b790-f48c8fe411f2">
      <Text>Only two yards? How you get paid then?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ed326be7-7df2-4ba2-92e0-b3a05dd288af">
      <Text>DanIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="04be6901-2a4f-4dd0-9fdc-26381f825826">
      <Text>That means two hundred, Nan. He did well today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c7896093-1984-4cf9-ac27-de19eb698f79">
      <Text>Nancy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="862a9e95-1a4a-4d6c-9444-52a5630f0921">
      <Text>Why you still call me that? You make me sound like someone’s grandma.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1484d1d7-d950-407f-920b-4c4c1254b39a">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ab23f058-17aa-48c7-a2e4-d0147f6bd4ac">
      <Text>Alright, Nan. Let’s go home.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e03a9f8c-db6a-479a-a0d7-3f93d2c30c96">
      <Text>NANCY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ba89ecbd-f50c-4948-a9cf-59c6230d455c">
      <Text>That’s Ma to you, boy. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="87064fd4-7e9c-4f90-9b22-b8c073055d25">
      <Text>DanieL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7027030a-198a-4d51-85ba-e3aaf5014f44">
      <Text>Play nice, you two. Family.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="06799ec3-963c-44b0-abc0-bb8fd5047ce9">
      <Text>Nancy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b8b2520b-f7e3-4bc0-9993-68224d363cba">
      <Text>Tell him to treat his mother with some respect.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2e294835-b4f5-429e-abe9-816be432e85c">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="038fb782-52db-478b-b23f-ecb7531fff1e">
      <Text>Tell her to take a joke if she’s always making them!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="df3126e1-373c-475e-8ed0-b88e3a7c93e5">
      <Text>DanIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3faa253d-bdc0-419f-8c9c-9d564b858c62">
      <Text>That’s enough.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d1f96167-9f7f-4985-8b4e-09a65fb66b72">
      <Text>Daniel takes out his keys and Nancy locks up shop behind him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="88e1da7a-a178-44a1-977f-8af1930d727e">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="6" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Scene 5: home life</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="88e1da7a-a178-44a1-977f-8af1930d727e">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 7/8" Page="6" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NANCY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="90577e1b-66ac-4fb2-bc58-1d6e991421c2"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="f7f5b3af-76f9-4284-9037-8b308f4731e8"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Shitty apartment - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="44cbbf5e-d602-48aa-b9b3-ed329ec7a5d8">
      <Text>Unsafe area. Nancy and Rye have a streamlined, seamless routine to enter as quickly as possible, a secret handshake. Elevator is broken so they sprint up the stairs. Nancy lags behind and begins coughing at the top.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5ddd742d-58b4-472d-a8f1-49c942d2df6c">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5ef6cff4-872f-4036-81d6-3bbddc55a57e">
      <Text>Ma, can you go any slower?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8ca04101-999a-4d48-a478-dcc8eaee1fb2">
      <Text>NancY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="55085cc3-c2fa-4328-9422-4eff0e526709">
      <Text>Can you be any more annoying?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3b2fdb71-cc9f-4e5e-a492-d96fde2aa0ba">
      <Text>They enter their rundown apartment with a broken lock. A nightstand with two jars. One has a taped note that says “College” and one says “House.” </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="d65ade1f-2601-4d5d-9595-736513d149f1">
      <Text>Rye drops his two hundreds into house jar. Nancy follows behind and moves both bills into college.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="952730bf-def7-4cb1-a96e-fbb72d615222">
      <Text>Rye goes to the fridge and the lights are off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="de81679b-ce2c-415d-bf01-d002cde47e9e">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="62965113-a48d-49ee-82fc-35df1db6964b">
      <Text>Ma, electricity is out again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7d28ae4e-3baf-4aad-94b8-5445075902d6">
      <Text>Nancy is already sprawled on the couch with a face mask on. Half a bottle of Hennessy is on the table.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="05fae9b0-c613-49a8-85fc-0cb3dfbef8bb">
      <Text>Nancy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6978c6f3-eb19-415a-a9ad-2507f5446fdf">
      <Text>Con </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">biet</Text>
      <Text> lam </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text>, ma. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6978c6f3-eb19-415a-a9ad-2507f5446fdf">
      <Text>Subtitles: You know what to do.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="29716136-8d06-422a-91db-7954b1b3cf79">
      <Text>Rye groans and walks over to the generator and smacks it until the lights turn back on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="df8c8c17-4c98-4ca1-863b-593a26e68488">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0107dc08-6164-439c-bf1b-ed0b944a34bb">
      <Text>Did you look at any houses with Daniel?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a7c4ff81-9f33-416e-948e-100c408c5a3f">
      <Text>Nancy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d194917c-580c-41d4-97a7-95da1abc0ee3">
      <Text>I’ll get to it after next week.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a9772a6d-6935-4139-a0ce-b70f3d0e864d">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="85102e62-d816-4974-9d39-eb89afaf3d28">
      <Text>Ma, please. You keep saying that. I can’t live here anymore.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ab4c0e33-8d90-404f-be84-7993a9021eae">
      <Text>Nancy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c27e0e25-0885-4e5c-a1b4-e1a7dbed6679">
      <Text>Okay, did you do any college applications?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2e4c4999-e25a-431c-9a0c-e73d5ffb8e74">
      <Text>RyE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="42c2c3ec-3b2e-4f0c-8444-d4c9eb8de7df">
      <Text>Yes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dd2bc88a-e953-4eac-8f8d-f4ac37e6bb35">
      <Text>NANCY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="15ca1576-e81b-48ac-b680-936c998a22de">
      <Text>Liar. You are a liar. To your own mother.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="59d88a07-a4e7-4b0c-b141-3e6d7785b24f">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="de3f06fb-3391-46cf-a716-12f6b63ba413">
      <Text>I did.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3f1ee5d2-c0c6-4bbb-99a8-6fb644bda721">
      <Text>Nancy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a25b6e4e-3bc7-4d5f-b6e1-d0626cb5fd48">
      <Text>To where?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="64884263-93f3-4616-b57f-0d6a428802e8">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5b2fec17-2288-457a-97c8-3e88c58f821d">
      <Text>Cascadia.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2a40c3f4-28e3-4630-b8b5-f073e06df898">
      <Text>Nancy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cecd4106-58b4-4e35-a859-dfb3f0a1c98a">
      <Text>Community? Are you serious? You think I left by boat for you to go to community?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="73ec0169-ac88-4792-be24-b8af27b27c40">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="93fab3d0-ef96-474c-85bf-e8a003b20872">
      <Text>It’s just in case. I’m not going anywhere good.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c8580068-3d60-4f88-9266-26d34234d1e2">
      <Text>Nancy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="09b7b982-0255-4898-bb21-0334e831f509">
      <Text>Are you even trying?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aed9ca07-52c0-4b85-8a66-8b5cca45b5b8">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1c73c7f8-1bcd-4c82-b97e-01dc2b330d0c">
      <Text>Yes. I am. I am always trying.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7bf48514-7197-47a2-a3de-c97d0e9e11d2">
      <Text>Nancy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b0d0f85-ff8b-4a29-b1b6-3074229c6858">
      <Text>Then why do I have to keep asking you this?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="67294435-ef95-4b7e-8a88-f4ccffec09a4">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4f4bf055-d4dd-4df7-bde4-8e2893cb5931">
      <Text>Then stop nagging me!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="39ea46b8-93f7-4c58-85ab-8074e0d48583">
      <Text>Nancy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="59543726-d814-4381-b05c-3406950f14c3">
      <Text>Then you’re going to end up like me. Young and pregnant and no money. Ever. And it won’t be my fault.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a1a83110-df4e-4cb6-a2e9-39249328c7d2">
      <Text>Rye storms to his room and moves two bills from College to House. Nancy is still on the couch relaxing, now eyes closed, she lets out a cough.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="e2df156e-d1ec-48e2-a7c6-09b0b12cd3b6">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="8" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Scene 6: rye school</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="e2df156e-d1ec-48e2-a7c6-09b0b12cd3b6">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="8" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LILY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="4fa91362-b20f-4cb8-af39-7d02779c831d"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="6b44761c-6ca5-4766-b7d2-e5e7a8c0e993"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. School parking lot - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9b6fa9d2-a4be-44fd-94bb-d2e9b3a5a35a">
      <Text>Rye rolls into the lot in his dingy landscaping truck. Rubbing sleep from his eyes, music playing. He parks and leans over a fence to the field where the football players are practicing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d11d1e48-0028-4263-90f2-09acae40dacc">
      <Text>LILY [18, cute, preppy] springs up and rests her head onto her shoulder. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="39afa55a-8e39-49bf-a9e8-37a4ee9a358e">
      <Text>Lily</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bd820ab9-e4b7-456f-86a1-861b0eb8ac56">
      <Text>Daydreaming again?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="08bdcbfa-d5d7-4668-b96c-37ae8896bd7b">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="329428b1-a375-4440-b8ed-7194eb8c153e">
      <Text>Just enjoying my morning view.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bb433c7b-0ccc-40f8-8868-d4463cc2fd01">
      <Text>Lily</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1339bf3b-8d87-4fc8-988e-f9aba9cafd4f">
      <Text>What about this morning view?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dc4a74bb-9ba7-4573-8b6e-53671d55c26c">
      <Text>Lily turns his cheek towards her and gives him a tender kiss.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="25154da7-cfb3-4bf3-b1c5-50d0bb138720">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9d9b8dcb-7d4c-400d-b95e-48a6053f709b">
      <Text>That works, too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e389e99b-58f0-4d92-a99d-665e62695070">
      <Text>Lily</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="13381390-abec-4450-88a5-92348b6a9765">
      <Text>Just works? God, I should really go where I’m appreciated, huh?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a9350b55-2cd6-49e9-88ea-59eea62160e7">
      <Text>RyE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2e88fb67-fbff-4170-a69e-e0bd5adfddc1">
      <Text>I’m sorry. Just tired.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a9dda81e-4f02-4fb5-b921-6677813f8469">
      <Text>Lily</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1624070e-ac05-484f-bb52-8d5fba5934ab">
      <Text>It’s okay. You always are.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1cf7c0bc-fb1a-4417-aa35-3837da16057f">
      <Text>Beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="973f996a-c5df-4f85-9de6-95ed884b9b85">
      <Text>Lily</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3dd28322-786d-43b0-8606-1e39e7088379">
      <Text>Let’s go to class. I brought you a cake pop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="176482c0-5534-4410-8da6-dd23e89f8ac1">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="11b0ecc9-eabd-4b58-b81e-545085b84ea0">
      <Text>Thank you, Lily Billy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="041b3846-d257-4349-abdc-bc10aeb85ec6">
      <Text>He kisses her forehead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="431ce444-20be-45f1-9fce-a51b7d74a21c">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Scene 7: dark academia</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="431ce444-20be-45f1-9fce-a51b7d74a21c">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="1d6e629e-0b15-4090-a77c-0ecb279dedb7"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TEACHER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="ebfec071-3a34-4933-bbd7-d98fefb15c69"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. classroom - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c9cdc9c5-7a21-49d7-aee6-f69a310743eb">
      <Text>TEACHER stands with arms crossed, gazing at watch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="67faf58e-0769-4dec-93d1-dd31345e6a46">
      <Text>Rye is writing frantically, brows furrowed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d7fc2604-9608-4ee3-98d5-10d080023dca">
      <Text>Teacher</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c7eb99e3-4d4a-4007-b3f7-184d410b6ce1">
      <Text>Times up! Pencils down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0764e806-aef1-43a6-8f34-ece7c3446aad">
      <Text>Lily neatly wipes eraser shavings off her page.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4f2272f3-2ae0-4ec0-85b9-d6b2dd11b7e4">
      <Text>Rye peers over and quickly copies off her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="575009de-3999-4e8d-b5d9-4092809570da">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="32b2dae3-d7d9-443c-9aa6-baa9e7aed41c">
      <Text>Fuck. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Fuckkkk</Text>
      <Text>....</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="09e6a70a-a986-497c-ad92-aebf487f8acd">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Scene 8: debrief</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="09e6a70a-a986-497c-ad92-aebf487f8acd">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LILY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="bd7a4964-113e-4637-8607-1dd6071b9dcc"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="d0f7bdbe-a417-418c-9580-5946f0481a83"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Hallway - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ee7b8d99-c93d-48ca-ba85-561e61aae80e">
      <Text>LILY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5e39079f-b91c-4369-9d3f-b5178d47b83f">
      <Text>What’d you think?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7299e0f0-e1c6-48c8-b8ee-de6487cb2906">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c7812244-db3f-4f46-839b-f43e57f5a567">
      <Text>Not enough apparently. I didn’t finish again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7a388b3e-2f8b-4652-9430-782bbbdcdf13">
      <Text>LiLY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9a8b50fb-a8fe-4032-9e06-8ea2606f21fd">
      <Text>You didn’t study, Rye?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d1dc6509-3909-4b4a-9eb0-cce8741d330d">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3dae3d68-53a1-4729-a86a-257ea7b89cd8">
      <Text>Lil, your two hours of studying is worth five of mine. It’s like, exponential.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="09138d1d-874c-4bda-a523-231e363deeba">
      <Text>LILY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="946578f7-59bd-48a1-a51b-fd468a63313b">
      <Text>Oh, Rye. If you talk like that, of course you don’t believe in yourself. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3598fb6c-64ed-45cf-98dd-8d851c9fc6c7">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="260d67b3-ea18-4f75-a0bf-fbe015a40b5a">
      <Text>I don’t care anymore, honestly. It’s a lost cause.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="29fab52c-3ef0-4d97-8f72-581f411a5944">
      <Text>LiLY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6be18f1e-936a-4653-8644-bd219bd44165">
      <Text>Yeah, with that non-growth mentality.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="575aa264-b7bd-4058-b415-be9f25e65bd5">
      <Text>Rye brushes it off and stops at a door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="068fe2fc-4136-4cd1-8600-de1c30c0653d">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f800330-bbff-4fff-b68c-8b20a22fec26">
      <Text>Bye. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Gotta</Text>
      <Text> make a visit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3af4f66c-a031-4f6f-bbeb-1b3d0d9029bb">
      <Text>LILY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0bf100b6-4fe5-4a3d-9a2e-7611ff7d95eb">
      <Text>Not eating lunch with me again?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2f42cf95-6b4b-4a82-91c9-52af2d076f31">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aa3b8af8-e40e-437a-b71b-41e8e989b194">
      <Text>Enjoy your croquette club or whatever rich people do.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="03e267b2-9d37-4bb4-93d2-0333d8ded2ab">
      <Text>LilY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="69e555b1-ae52-4a53-8cb5-9a222d4c8c64">
      <Text>How many times do I have to tell you croquette is a potato?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="25c03e10-30bf-4cbc-91b3-27bbe34abcc7"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4c718641-e644-4e48-8ae3-bd7c01a41290">
      <Text>LiLY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ba557478-173d-4171-901c-a372729a94bc">
      <Text>And don’t forget about dinner tonight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="221b48c4-eff4-4a40-ba77-3256a3f7f750">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="13e1ea34-b878-4401-be6a-78666b4001ba">
      <Text>Fuck...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a79a7d49-d5c9-41d5-980b-bf202a656c47">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="10" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Scene 9: lunch break</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a79a7d49-d5c9-41d5-980b-bf202a656c47">
      <SceneProperties Length="3" Page="10" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="6324d453-e697-43aa-95e2-85f6c6fb4a10"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="2a75e0f7-a272-4460-af31-192e436bc7f9"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Daniel’s classroom - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="481a3e87-defa-48fd-bd65-a71dbea9388f">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f9766b2b-5253-4ba4-9ad4-7a67de95d657">
      <Text>Hey, Big D.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7ce1a7ba-78a9-49e2-9586-a8a5d5753f02">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dd5d23a6-5017-45e1-bb4f-e561f2591dce">
      <Text>What’d I say about that name on school grounds, Rye?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="08ed3933-9da5-4c63-bb10-d19f297afa85">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="12c9adc9-287c-42db-88f9-b7de96662654">
      <Text>Uh, probably the same thing you said at home.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="132d69f1-c6f5-4f1c-855f-0d1af44432cd">
      <Text>DanIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5444be98-41bb-45ae-b2ba-aec44c6ebfc3">
      <Text>Which was?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9e56c1ce-9569-41da-8c00-53555768377a">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b5a90fef-cd91-48de-9fa1-565e344e9065">
      <Text>It’s not that big.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e13b4a98-0af4-4c24-b121-baebcd71bb2d">
      <Text>Daniel sighs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7c2571aa-d7d1-44b1-b3a3-c2bfbe1d2587">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a091b930-4994-4d2d-a20a-48cb92cf5e44">
      <Text>Alright, Rye Guy. Let’s open that document.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a55f1ec-62f6-45e5-be04-8752d4bf46a0">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="60bc0f17-52a0-4b97-9c6b-f50e3761f113">
      <Text>Aw, come on, D-Boy! Can you never just hang out with me?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ef958384-33b3-4295-bfc8-0f5032c86014">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3fca1ab1-0adc-47e5-946e-222ae190ac5d">
      <Text>Was it not hanging out when we watched the entirety of the Lakers game together?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="77f8634a-81c4-485d-9a8b-90f363e63b41">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="97d6c9f2-799c-4eda-a0f1-814522441973">
      <Text>No more LeBron. It’s like watching an old video of your dead wife.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5853204a-cd3a-4640-a413-fcc72648cfdc">
      <Text>Daniel shakes his head and tries to not laugh.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ccb5312d-432b-4d54-b1be-0d40fe2cde22">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9dbfaa1f-5e59-4f23-a394-9944aafb2189">
      <Text>Please just open it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2833de6a-4fa7-422e-8f71-e1d806b8fcea">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a2eb9df4-b5b7-4ee5-bb66-5ce45c00ea83">
      <Text>Fine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1b2e0587-2767-4198-b064-12a10e959d0a">
      <Text>He moves deliberately slow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="01d6098f-eeba-4aa0-a874-97f4fdc93f76">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b61fc442-83f2-452c-9220-046418abdda6">
      <Text>Lunch is only 30 minutes. Is there something you want to share with me?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd4fb6f3-76b3-4475-bc8a-3340c22b0d52">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="30cb8f39-ab7b-4688-94b8-e32218681983">
      <Text>And what if I told you I was trying to use up 29 minutes because I haven’t written anything since last time?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="29c36b3c-e340-4ee2-a9e3-1b43fd900677">
      <Text>Daniel sighs again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6ba08926-256b-4d89-81ca-ebfada378ddf">
      <Text>DaniEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3128882f-fcd9-4b45-af0e-c5181bf6731e">
      <Text>Why don’t you want to do this? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d78b72a7-29f1-4e97-8c51-62aad025ff28">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="db44c5eb-b154-46c4-ad7e-6c13a094a3f0">
      <Text>Who said I don’t? I get busy, I get tired. It’s nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="78fc49d3-f2eb-48f0-8dc5-814ec2a3767c">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="11781c14-8e4c-48e3-96e8-0aca1a46927a">
      <Text>No. I work with hundreds of you. I can tell when someone is just tired. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f4ed7537-f659-42ea-b1b9-aab7a42692fb">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d2871aee-87e8-4118-ae81-268ab097c868">
      <Text>It’s nothing. It’s stupid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1e69d1d5-abe5-4b11-a7c0-b4b4cac7101d">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f9876cbc-1ae6-4336-abac-f42bf4b47626">
      <Text>What is? Your reason, or college?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2dd7bfa6-da79-4b14-add5-0133cdf8eab6">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c6c98c61-ee55-4c88-ac2c-1bd075a6ce6e">
      <Text>Both! What, you practically write my essay for me, then I go to college and I’m just dumber than everyone else? Small fish begging to join a big pond?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="420e13d8-3e51-478d-bccf-1b399b8587f4">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="968ddd2c-649e-4bbb-85d9-94c486e7d85b">
      <Text>Confucius once said—”When frying small fish, disturb them little.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b5ca1286-e393-4cbd-b173-ba7ddc8d7bad">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="730f19cd-423f-42da-9fe1-07739fd5579c">
      <Text>See? You not even Asian and you knew Confucius before me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb297dad-1ae9-4e2e-b9f0-bb0c7b36ee79">
      <Text>DanIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a921dc1a-d114-4aae-8cd4-abc5281b7672">
      <Text>It can all be learned if you want to learn.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5d483d4c-9cd9-4107-acf8-155146c72a64">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="251add48-2d6b-49c6-a963-88f2a891ea2d">
      <Text>I don’t want to learn. Mom wants me to learn. But not because I want to. Because she didn’t get to.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="528937c1-905e-49a9-b448-3afa8b9bfd9e">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bb60531e-96e9-44cf-92f9-047fe9307e2c">
      <Text>Do you really feel that way? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d4ac2e0f-f5cf-4062-992c-4b78b5ef7eb6">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9cfb8c27-752a-44cc-a8ef-189a7bd4d6e9">
      <Text>Yes, always.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bf33d784-c19a-47e4-9bb1-f12bf337c3b3">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7625f924-208b-4aa9-a599-eef0ecd6de9c">
      <Text>She just wants what’s best for you. You know that, don’t you? We don’t have all the time in the world in our hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f73fbfe4-d678-4c37-95a8-a9331def97ee">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5ac432ca-4711-45f4-8bd1-1721b738693d">
      <Text>And how does she know what’s best? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5d00121d-d77a-45b2-b167-5539b703c050">
      <Text>Beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5450e5ad-e477-4ad0-b939-eee06a106501">
      <Text>RyE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5ac432ca-4711-45f4-8bd1-1721b738693d">
      <Text>I’m big. I know that. I’m strong. I know that. But that doesn’t mean I’m smart. Why is that so bad?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d9e997ff-80a4-48f0-8626-897f87ff00bf">
      <Text>DaNIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7ab06cb9-f6d0-4d6a-8c9c-685b00b321ea">
      <Text>You’re so much smarter than you know... and these schools don’t want perfection. They want coachability, they want growth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9f5af60b-b68b-4640-8ee0-7cdfd74a4342">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="770dd8ca-4bc2-4a48-bf39-0544caae13df">
      <Text>Well, unfortunately, I’m not a football player either. I know what I am and I’m not ashamed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8244f3c3-f719-4b35-898b-24a3180b091e">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c53a11b3-aff7-42bc-abc6-2ccf61445a92">
      <Text>Okay, Rye. If you won’t do it for you, or your mom, will you do some writing? For me?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9f8876ad-1712-4cb6-a74d-003fd6fd0039">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e750b39-90ae-4f4b-9e82-e01f9134faae">
      <Text>Oh, don’t pull this card on me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="384ba3d7-2162-4e00-9a81-7f4da3c34a62">
      <Text>DanIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3bb0d402-30f3-4623-96d0-1f52d42a9842">
      <Text>It’s not a card. I’m a teacher. I need a refreshing perspective now and then. Write about you. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2cc0eef6-2d4a-483a-be98-d5c8f3a8e3b4">
      <Text>Rye hesitates.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9f170d83-006c-4a20-8ad3-2a6a91426ca5">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b221c0dd-4e07-4f7e-a250-c9f4027cf4c9">
      <Text>Think about how many nerds I have to read essays for.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="103304a0-a7d7-4d03-bef8-c0376aeb8641">
      <Text>Beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3bb0d402-30f3-4623-96d0-1f52d42a9842"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3bb0d402-30f3-4623-96d0-1f52d42a9842">
      <Text>Tell me about a favorite childhood memory of yours that I wouldn’t know about.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1b26242d-76ba-4205-b277-82ba59c2366a">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="13" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="e6324462-5101-4ed4-b23e-2009d42af7ea"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Scene 10: childhood flashback sequence</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9fde86f0-f758-4c8b-aa03-57bf018f0dc5">
      <Text>Montage of Rye’s childhood routine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d4f1f844-ea2e-46a4-a7bf-10ede8cd54f0">
      <Text>Rye (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc47ebc2-e779-490a-a5b0-5f6b422ddb7d">
      <Text>I grew up in that salon with the marble floors and sticker tiles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="db072525-10c6-4c52-9b14-6144ec04afae">
      <Text>RYE (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dd530712-973b-4c5a-a005-191106b66482">
      <Text>They were nicer than the apartment, so I went there everyday after school and played on the chairs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cde4876a-865d-43b8-8881-43662b42a4dd">
      <Text>RYE (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8547e838-1f7d-4553-b6db-2d58fb5ba109">
      <Text>My mom never got to sit by those ladies. She was always massaging their feet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b1d39884-c1e5-42bc-b87d-84051ff32929">
      <Text>RYE (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="47450629-7b8d-46d2-8af1-07f886601fb5">
      <Text>But she always said that, if I felt bad for her, I was telling her she should be embarrassed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b1fd5766-9fdb-40c0-a0a9-e24d53c91dd7">
      <Text>RYE (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5e6259a1-51ad-4df6-ab62-85b26461e083">
      <Text>But I think deep down, she was always ashamed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="45be606e-9356-4338-a0a3-90002a3537fa">
      <Text>Rye (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8e7569b3-4370-4198-90dc-de61e09020bc">
      <Text>But what she didn’t know was that I didn’t really care because when that My Trang lady came in, she would always soak the rhinestones off in the foot bath. And while she wasn’t looking, I would keep those rhinestones for myself and feed them to the fish like food.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="92e601ca-0639-4afa-96f8-e167ea16a1b9">
      <Text>RYE (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="18287bcf-7bc8-42d1-a65d-0e82a45fb556">
      <Text>And I would always get sad when those fish died, so Ma would take me to get a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">McFlurry</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="20d58108-3291-4505-8003-b16ae0f9d815">
      <Text>RYE (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8ccf90a9-7680-4e02-bdaa-bf6d93d74dd4">
      <Text>So, I guess. I just kept killing the fish which made me sad but then I got ice cream which made me happy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="8f753c11-f735-4c5d-845c-223793268c62">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="14" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Scene 11: nail routine</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a1d5eb72-edee-49fd-9dd2-dd3a758b4e62">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="14" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NANCY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="30b6c570-1d44-4223-93bd-f136d957d7d6"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="59aab154-4af9-41a3-9b96-fc42a5bb890d"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Nail sALON - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="900ae24d-7f30-4c5c-8396-c2f2d9bcc568">
      <Text>Rye comes through the door. Nancy is painting a client’s nails.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="52e92062-8ca9-4d3e-bdff-97e0f5e22fed">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="44578ed8-7158-454b-a075-7a5f03fd3be9">
      <Text>ICE here to come get Nancy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d9196dd6-1261-46a3-a2a0-7233729eebad">
      <Text>NanCY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e1b137c0-4626-4d30-8a82-3c2348d812d5">
      <Text>Nancy here to whoop Rye’s butt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b3878aa9-50cc-4292-b920-5aee819e2b33">
      <Text>Rye is holding a baggy. Nancy stays focused but pauses to let out a cough.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d7fbcb11-d36a-4523-a119-631e1e1c7c6c">
      <Text>RyE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d39f995e-fe65-4561-926b-828483f272d6">
      <Text>Daniel bought you some banh mi. I ate most of it already.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8ea456e5-6b90-4563-8bea-b9bde204100f">
      <Text>NaNCY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dbb7ee08-4cd1-4cea-8aea-e7d60ab23654">
      <Text>Thank you, con.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2b764a9c-618e-4281-86f9-a9ebb3aa6da1">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6addc75f-7390-4ac7-a5ef-76d8627d4bb6">
      <Text>I worked on the essay today, too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e62ecfa6-e3ca-4510-a813-8bccb9f82b81">
      <Text>Nancy finally turns.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="356729a3-4dc4-4677-8b51-c6e45f32add8">
      <Text>NANCY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aad94178-eb87-41fc-b7d8-4bf4c78a2c9f">
      <Text>Oh, good, con! What did you write about?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d8f96fc3-efe1-47f5-b77b-5f09fc3aff88">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c692318e-9f2a-4cc2-b2bb-b2421bc80d2c">
      <Text>How I used to kill the fish and you would take me to get </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">McFlurries</Text>
      <Text> after.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="334e420c-e7f0-43e8-86d6-f3d957dd431d">
      <Text>NANCY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5f1c9025-ca53-4b59-8155-2df444233857">
      <Text>Con co </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">dien</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">khong</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e3c7cd36-99e3-44ef-8a64-8dec9707f64d">
      <Text>Subtitles: Are you crazy?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a80e8307-6b52-4341-a148-ea583a6861bb">
      <Text>NanCY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="253006c2-26dd-4997-9b44-b07fedeb96a6">
      <Text>They’re going to think you a serial killer!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d77c95fd-8bc4-443d-81fe-88fc9419bebf">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6784cb2a-353a-4bb0-9bf0-ca1625d0da25">
      <Text>Well. At least I wrote. Let’s see what Daniel says.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc34f960-76c0-4787-8bc6-0ef50870403c">
      <Text>Nancy shakes her head and goes back to work, but continues coughing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a79fab4c-5ba6-4f7e-9874-73b10ef0a534">
      <Text>RyE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="948bb9aa-47ea-4a82-b711-5ae8cc0ea070">
      <Text>I’m going now. Two lawns today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d7f7f585-3996-4491-b8bd-bcfebea418f3">
      <Text>He looks over hoping for some reassurance. Crickets.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7603489b-9b6c-4f80-87c7-d066badf6658">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a847aa47-0063-4e26-a354-96c55201e843">
      <Text>Why are you coughing so much?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="18afd87e-68e7-4d19-9942-bbf215b9a4a3">
      <Text>NANCY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6c2744e0-1372-4a24-babc-2a7f4393e840">
      <Text>Bye, con. Food in the fridge at home. And don’t write anymore bullshit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3fc08d60-84b1-47de-8be7-03d20b9ce936">
      <Text>Rye leaves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d8835a6c-0c31-4b66-8140-b0a5ffe1ce6a">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="15" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Scene 12: the discovery</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="db3ad671-7e7e-4524-9765-87f9ec590346">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="16" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. ShittY APARTMENT - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d74f4634-77e2-4843-8a02-80e9c7755803">
      <Text>Rye is looking in the mirror, adjusting his shirt to hide a stain and shaving his stubble.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c07a2d08-9db3-46ef-834e-1596d037fedb">
      <Text>He grabs deodorant from the mirror cabinet and sees a pill jar. He pockets it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="7f514b8b-9af8-4b13-8c07-6d6024f7943a">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="16" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Scene 13: dinner at lily’s</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="293d93f5-e0c2-4f39-b50d-bc42640e79b9">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="16" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LILY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="e9d5e68a-b21e-4784-9678-9fb1cfb5b2e3"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="cb1ed9a7-cf2b-46f8-91d3-62acaaf7c52e"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Beautiful home - evening</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bc04a732-76d6-4746-9421-9a3d277a653c">
      <Text>Rye rings the doorbell with a cheap bouquet in hand. Lily opens the door excitedly and they hug. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="754a9e7b-48bc-488c-b4ac-1f4cb2b794cf">
      <Text>LiLY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e1500d65-7bea-465a-8b88-955450aded65">
      <Text>You know you don’t have to!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d362c4ad-d8d7-4faf-b209-c933f71beed6">
      <Text>RyE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="43507e6a-cb1b-48dc-82fc-37597910396f">
      <Text>Yes, I’m just the best boyfriend ever.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="044d02c7-a09a-40ed-a9bd-8afc0606a05f">
      <Text>LiLY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="00944a69-ab5d-4b28-bb1f-7f71dd0195cf">
      <Text>Come in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3abe4900-a77b-4881-9d81-6efafee5352b">
      <Text>Rye enters and we take in all the surroundings with him while Lily takes the flowers and puts them in a fancy vase. Fancy paintings, gold accents, and ornate dolls. Rye picks one up and plays with it in his hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="08573cba-0853-4ba2-9045-e5305ff39412">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7db82857-9df2-466f-96ec-6b55e103c2a3">
      <Text>These are still creepy as hell.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d5826391-93a0-4623-bf19-f299d259f04f">
      <Text>LILY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="97f50b71-55c8-4e69-9336-623265d7e6c8">
      <Text>My parents. Collectibles. Worth a lot, you know. It’s like the weirder the shape, the more it costs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="32625f4b-dc60-49fb-98cb-dea4f3e1aaa9">
      <Text>Rye</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b7e2a8dd-8013-45e1-83ce-2325bc1c52ab">
      <Text>Can I talk to your mom about something?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f36f66c7-9172-4dc9-9beb-7d292c8f9359">
      <Text>Lily</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="07688cc4-bbdd-40a4-9f28-c7c2d733385c">
      <Text>Yeah, what is it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5859e807-ea21-4e78-81ee-4b3dcd02e0ee">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="344b08b7-ccf0-4501-9dfe-7cc1013820fa">
      <Text>I found this. And my mom’s been coughing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1a7db9b2-f84d-4ee5-9cdf-54e2c7000700">
      <Text>He hands over the pill container. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c4cac51d-098c-47da-892a-f2807549fe4b">
      <Text>LILY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="48fd0f44-4e0c-46d8-bc7f-6c7141245768">
      <Text>Oh. I mean, it could be like how people take Ozempic without being diabetic. For aesthetics?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1813e85f-480e-40b4-a3aa-8d2a000ea88e">
      <Text>RYE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2c8f7ff0-806b-4cfc-8a7d-83aabc6890ad">
      <Text>I looked it up and it’s for cancer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9284d1ff-da73-47bd-ab2e-73cd2a0d0907"/>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="15" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Summary" id="9e2a63c0-14ed-4af4-ae68-4aa82c8af413"/>
  </Content>

